{"id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","title":"Measure Space","display":"df-measure-space — Measure Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measure-space","aliases":["58-df-measure-space","Measure Space","58-df-zfc-measure2-measure-space"],"display":"df-measure-space — Measure Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measure-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-measure-space</span><span>Measure Space</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-measure-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measure-space — Measure Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (defined here; measure space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measure\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathr